OL,3,GNEWSAWoman rescued after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto ditch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been described as a "saint"
OL,7,Fafter he jumped into water to rescue a
OL,8,Fwoman from a car that crashed into in a
OL,9,Fditch in East Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe vehicle, ended up partially
OL,12,Fsubmerged in the Beverley and Barmston
OL,13,FDrain, near Bethells Bridge, on
OL,14,FSaturday evening.
OL,16,FCharles Wrieden, who was on his way to
OL,17,Fa nearby bonfire, spotted the vehicle
OL,18,Fand jumped into the water to help.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
