OL,3,GNEWSAWoman rescued after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto ditch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver, who wished to be known only
OL,7,Fas Liz, said she had "never been so
OL,8,Frelieved to see anyone" as when Charles
OL,9,Fcame to her rescue.
